(2, 5, "Majburiy holat va kasallikning to‘g‘ri juftliklarini belgilang.",
 ["Oyoqlarini tushirib o‘tirish — yurak astmasi", "Qo‘llarini stolga tirab, oldinga egilib o‘tirish — bronxial astma xuruji", "Sog‘ tomonga yotish — qovurg‘a sinishi", "“Ov iti” holati — meningit", "Cho‘nqayib o‘tirish — Fallo tetradasi", "U yondan bu yonga ag‘darilish — ekssudativ perikardit", "Chalqancha qimirlamay yotish — buyrak sanchig‘i", "Oldinga egilib o‘tirish — qovurg‘a sinishi", "To‘satdan to‘xtab qolish — o‘pka absessi", "Zararlangan tomonga yotish — meningit"],
 "Mark the correct pairs of forced position and disease.",
 ["Sitting with legs down — cardiac asthma", "Leaning forward with hands on a table — asthma attack", "Lying on the healthy side — rib fracture", "“Pointer dog” position — meningitis", "Squatting — tetralogy of Fallot", "Tossing from side to side — effusive pericarditis", "Lying still on the back — renal colic", "Leaning forward — rib fracture", "Suddenly stopping still — lung abscess", "Lying on the affected side — meningitis"],
 "Ag‘darilish — buyrak va o‘t sanchig‘i; qimirlamay yotish — o‘tkir qorin; to‘xtab qolish — stenokardiya.",
 "Tossing about is renal or biliary colic; lying still is an acute abdomen; stopping still is angina."),
